{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "The Calling",
    "steam_appid": 3830400,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830400/extras/54ce0a7d801a5b11579fffce75c7d2fe.avif?t=1754512172\" width=1200 height=210 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830400/extras/3ec20c9cfee71f79e8c98a7a3396f577.poster.avif?t=1754512172\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830400/extras/3ec20c9cfee71f79e8c98a7a3396f577.webm?t=1754512172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830400/extras/3ec20c9cfee71f79e8c98a7a3396f577.mp4?t=1754512172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Featuring a roster of over 40 streamers and growing!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick your favorite streamers and drop into this fast-paced anime-inspired team-vs-team third person shooter featuring a roster of over 40 streamers (with dozens more already on the way and have yet to be announced), voiced by the actual streamers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The final release will feature an in-game shop where you will be able to customize the look of your favorite streamers by purchasing alternate skins/cosmetics for their characters, which also directly supports the streamers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830400/extras/a35f0377f42368a5c8f41f48c555c62c.avif?t=1754512172\" data-has-big width=800 height=982 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multi-Layered Maps and Game Modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Calling features a variety of maps and game modes such as Team Elimination, Control, Free-For-All, and Battle Royale that will provide lots of ways to engage with the enemy. Cleverly designed to level the playing field, players will need to keep moving and thinking tactically to stay alive because behind every sniper perch there will always be a way for the enemy to get behind your defenses. As the game develops, more maps and game modes will be made available in this fast-paced tactical shooter.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dynamically Changing Weather</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weather will change from day to night, sunny to overcast, clear to foggy, and may even rain, thunderstorm, or you might even get treated to shooting stars and meteor showers! Change up your tactics up with the weather as it can throw extra challenges throughout each round.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830400/extras/45f1b3ccf0b6da0326c1d81d0ac37ff8.poster.avif?t=1754512172\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830400/extras/45f1b3ccf0b6da0326c1d81d0ac37ff8.webm?t=1754512172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830400/extras/45f1b3ccf0b6da0326c1d81d0ac37ff8.mp4?t=1754512172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play Your Way</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize class-based abilities to thwart your enemy. Not only will you be able to play as your favorite streamer, but unlike other hero-shooters, you'll also be able to play each character using your own unique style. Choose your hero, then choose your kit, then support your team the way you know best.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >More to come!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed closely in collaboration with the streaming community and their viewers, we listen closely to what the fans want most in the game and do our best to deliver. This is truly a game built by streamers for streamers and their fan communities!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830400/extras/54ce0a7d801a5b11579fffce75c7d2fe.avif?t=1754512172\" width=1200 height=210 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830400/extras/3ec20c9cfee71f79e8c98a7a3396f577.poster.avif?t=1754512172\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830400/extras/3ec20c9cfee71f79e8c98a7a3396f577.webm?t=1754512172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830400/extras/3ec20c9cfee71f79e8c98a7a3396f577.mp4?t=1754512172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Featuring a roster of over 40 streamers and growing!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick your favorite streamers and drop into this fast-paced anime-inspired team-vs-team third person shooter featuring a roster of over 40 streamers (with dozens more already on the way and have yet to be announced), voiced by the actual streamers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The final release will feature an in-game shop where you will be able to customize the look of your favorite streamers by purchasing alternate skins/cosmetics for their characters, which also directly supports the streamers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830400/extras/a35f0377f42368a5c8f41f48c555c62c.avif?t=1754512172\" data-has-big width=800 height=982 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multi-Layered Maps and Game Modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Calling features a variety of maps and game modes such as Team Elimination, Control, Free-For-All, and Battle Royale that will provide lots of ways to engage with the enemy. Cleverly designed to level the playing field, players will need to keep moving and thinking tactically to stay alive because behind every sniper perch there will always be a way for the enemy to get behind your defenses. As the game develops, more maps and game modes will be made available in this fast-paced tactical shooter.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dynamically Changing Weather</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weather will change from day to night, sunny to overcast, clear to foggy, and may even rain, thunderstorm, or you might even get treated to shooting stars and meteor showers! Change up your tactics up with the weather as it can throw extra challenges throughout each round.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830400/extras/45f1b3ccf0b6da0326c1d81d0ac37ff8.poster.avif?t=1754512172\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830400/extras/45f1b3ccf0b6da0326c1d81d0ac37ff8.webm?t=1754512172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830400/extras/45f1b3ccf0b6da0326c1d81d0ac37ff8.mp4?t=1754512172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play Your Way</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize class-based abilities to thwart your enemy. Not only will you be able to play as your favorite streamer, but unlike other hero-shooters, you'll also be able to play each character using your own unique style. Choose your hero, then choose your kit, then support your team the way you know best.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >More to come!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed closely in collaboration with the streaming community and their viewers, we listen closely to what the fans want most in the game and do our best to deliver. This is truly a game built by streamers for streamers and their fan communities!</p>",
    "short_description": "Assemble a squad of your favorite live-streamers and battle for dominance in this PvP shooter featuring a growing cast of over 40 popular and upcoming streamers (with more on the way). This game is built by streamers for streamers and their fanbases.",
